{"text": "From: Samantha Beers/R3/USEPA/US\n\nSent: 10/22/2010 11:08:32 AM\nTo: Shawn Garvin/R3/USEPA/US@EPA,; William Early/R3/USEPA/US; Megan Mackey/R3/USEPA/US\ncc: Troy Jordan/R3/USEPA/US@EPA,; Chip Hosford/R3/USEPA/US@EPA\nSubject: Fw: Marcellus gas drilling photo essay\nBill and Shawn:\n\nAttached please find material from a citizen in Washington Township PA documenting her concerns regarding Marcellus\n\nShale operations in her community Ex 5 . D e | i be rat i ve\n\nIt is interesting to note the circuitous route this took in getting to region 3.\n\nEx. 5 - Deliberative\n\nSamantha Phillips Beers\nDirector,\nEnforcement, Compliance and Environmental Justice\nEPA Region 3\n215-814-2627\n_\u2014\u2014-- Forwarded by Samantha Beers/R3/USEPA/US on 10/22/2010 10:36 AM -----\n\nKenneth Gigliello/DC/USEPA/US\n. To Samantha Beers/R3/USEPA/US@EPA, Troy\n10/22/2010 10:27 AM Jordan/R3/USEPA/US@EPA, Chip\nHosford/R3/USEPA/US@EPA\ncc Mike Gaydosh/R8/USEPA/US@EPA, Jerry\nSaunders/R6/USEPA/US@EPA, Stephen\nGilrein/R6/USEPA/US@EPA\nSubject Fw: Marcellus gas drilling photo essay\n\nSamantha/Troy/Chip: | don't know if this was sent to you since it came from the Region II Regional Administrator. If\nyou click on the pdf file there is an comprehensive description from a private citizen with some excellent photos regarding\nsome of potential problems associated with oil and gas drilling in Pennsylvania.\n\nFrom: Kathleen Malone/R2/USEPA/US\nTo: Adam Kushner/DC/USEPA/US@EPA\nCc: Bernadette Rappold/DC/USEPA/US@EPA, Kenneth Gigliello/DC/USEPA/US@EPA\nDate: 10/22/2010 07:54 AM\nSubject: Fw: Marcellus gas drilling photo essay\n\nMr Kushner,\n\nMy Regional Administrator wanted me to send you the pdf on the super mister. The link for some reason did not work\nsince the % actually need to be there. However, the photo essay is all over the web so | downloaded and attached it for\nyour convenience. If you have problems opening it let me know. | am ccing two members of the OECA SIT team for On-\nShore Gas Extraction & Production Initiative so they are aware. | will also be contacting other regions to see if they have\nother examples.\n\nKathleen Malone-Bogusky\nR2 Shale Gas Extraction & Production Coordinator\nR2 Federal Facilities Program Manager\n\nDIM0039857 DIM0039857",
